                     <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">The Concurrent Enrollment form is necessary ONLY when:</p><ol style="font-size:10pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><li style="font-size:12pt">You are<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">Pell grant</span> eligible or Cal Grant Access eligible.</li><li style="font-size:12pt">You are enrolled in<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">6 -11 units</span> at Cal State Fullerton.</li><li style="font-size:12pt">You<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">HAVE NOT</span> transferred 70 or more Community College units to Cal State Fullerton.</li></ol><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">INSTRUCTIONS</p><ul style="font-size:10pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in;list-style-type:disc"><li style="font-size:12pt">Completely fill out the<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">student section.</span></li><li style="font-size:12pt">Obtain certification from the<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">Registrar’s Office and the Financial Aid Office</span> at the other school you are attending.</li><li style="font-size:12pt">Return form to<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span><span style="font-weight:bold">CSU, Fullerton, Office of Financial Aid.</span></li><li style="font-size:12pt">Allow<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span><span style="font-weight:bold">3- 4 weeks</span><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>for your request to be processed</li><li style="font-size:12pt">Must submit 1 week prior to the end of semester.</li><li style="font-size:12pt">Form submitted after<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">                            </span>will not be accepted.</li></ul></body>
